    "detailed_description": "<h1>Support us: wishlist and follow now!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/c6d974516a707dd8c75aa3551c1099c4.poster.avif?t=1742825205\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/c6d974516a707dd8c75aa3551c1099c4.webm?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/c6d974516a707dd8c75aa3551c1099c4.mp4?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEPLANDERS is a cozy and relaxing, minimalist building game where you must satisfy the needs of the Deeplanders to populate the depths. Explore, build, and decorate your own underground kingdom... and when you're ready, embark on a journey to new, unexplored depths!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/1d51de88213e1e9ef8e67e435fb6c068.poster.avif?t=1742825205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/1d51de88213e1e9ef8e67e435fb6c068.webm?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/1d51de88213e1e9ef8e67e435fb6c068.mp4?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>These charming characters, the Deeplanders, are eager to colonize the underground realms, but you'll have to satisfy their needs if you want them to keep coming. And not everyone wants the same things, so keeping them all happy won't be easy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/8891872a679f115349dd131bb8282dfe.poster.avif?t=1742825205\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/8891872a679f115349dd131bb8282dfe.webm?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/8891872a679f115349dd131bb8282dfe.mp4?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you build and expand your community, you\u2019ll unlock new areas. Each depth is completed with the arrival of a new King, at which point you can either focus on decorating the surroundings or simply enjoy watching the Deeplanders live their lives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/14c38881f53eb817327f8da88c3e9ca4.poster.avif?t=1742825205\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/14c38881f53eb817327f8da88c3e9ca4.webm?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/14c38881f53eb817327f8da88c3e9ca4.mp4?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Conquer each level and get ready to dig even deeper!</strong><br><br><strong>In DEEPLANDERS you can:</strong><br>Build, populate, and decorate incredible underground landscapes.<br>Play at your own pace, without time pressure.<br>Feel like a god creating underground communities. :)<br>Feel like a servant to the demands of the inhabitants. :(<br>Relax while watching the Deeplanders enjoy life.<br><br><strong>DEEPLANDERS does NOT offer:</strong><br>Leaderboards! There are no points to compete for.<br>Defeats\u2026 here you just play, and as you satisfy the Deeplanders, you advance.<br>Huge battles\u2026 no one dies here!<br>Mining simulation.<br>Resource management or microtransactions to get them.<br>Local or online multiplayer.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEPLANDERS is a cozy and relaxing, minimalist building game where you must satisfy the needs of the Deeplanders to populate the depths. Explore, build, and decorate your own underground kingdom... and when you're ready, embark on a journey to new, unexplored depths!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/1d51de88213e1e9ef8e67e435fb6c068.poster.avif?t=1742825205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/1d51de88213e1e9ef8e67e435fb6c068.webm?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/1d51de88213e1e9ef8e67e435fb6c068.mp4?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>These charming characters, the Deeplanders, are eager to colonize the underground realms, but you'll have to satisfy their needs if you want them to keep coming. And not everyone wants the same things, so keeping them all happy won't be easy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/8891872a679f115349dd131bb8282dfe.poster.avif?t=1742825205\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/8891872a679f115349dd131bb8282dfe.webm?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/8891872a679f115349dd131bb8282dfe.mp4?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you build and expand your community, you\u2019ll unlock new areas. Each depth is completed with the arrival of a new King, at which point you can either focus on decorating the surroundings or simply enjoy watching the Deeplanders live their lives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/14c38881f53eb817327f8da88c3e9ca4.poster.avif?t=1742825205\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/14c38881f53eb817327f8da88c3e9ca4.webm?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/14c38881f53eb817327f8da88c3e9ca4.mp4?t=1742825205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Conquer each level and get ready to dig even deeper!</strong><br><br><strong>In DEEPLANDERS you can:</strong><br>Build, populate, and decorate incredible underground landscapes.<br>Play at your own pace, without time pressure.<br>Feel like a god creating underground communities. :)<br>Feel like a servant to the demands of the inhabitants. :(<br>Relax while watching the Deeplanders enjoy life.<br><br><strong>DEEPLANDERS does NOT offer:</strong><br>Leaderboards! There are no points to compete for.<br>Defeats\u2026 here you just play, and as you satisfy the Deeplanders, you advance.<br>Huge battles\u2026 no one dies here!<br>Mining simulation.<br>Resource management or microtransactions to get them.<br>Local or online multiplayer.",
